  {
   "text": "Kate drove to Yosemite in January without tire chains.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.897
  },
  {
   "text": "At the chain control sign, she was turned back.",
   "start": 3.997,
   "end": 6.478
  },
  {
   "text": "In winter you must carry chains there, even with four-wheel drive or a rental car.",
   "start": 6.628,
   "end": 11.529
  },
  {
   "text": "Pack them before you leave.",
   "start": 11.629,
   "end": 12.971
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for your trip.",
   "start": 13.271,
   "end": 14.46
